WEBVTT

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:12.440
May this next year be a good one.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:21.730
“Great fortune”, it says!

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.790
That’s great!

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.090
Silly superstitions.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.160
You made it into college too!
This is a good sign of things to come.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.320
Now, the only thing left is for things to go well with you and Onii-chan.

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:38.510
Well...

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:44.460
Are your studies going well?

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.950
Irie-kun will get accepted into Tokyo University, right?

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.910
Iri-chan is an alumnus there after all.

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:51.370
I still haven’t decided if I’m going to go to Tokyo University.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.900
Hey, are you seriously saying that?

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.920
Now, now. He can decide after he takes the center exam.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.490
Ah, Onii-chan, how was your fortune?

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:06.290
Nothing important was written on it.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:42.650
Morning! It’s been a while.

00:02:42.650 --> 00:02:44.480
Ah, Kotoko, morning.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:46.630
Good luck this year too.

00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:49.970
But, this really is a happy third term.

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:52.500
We’ll be college students
in three months, eh?

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.170
Hey! Happy New Year!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:59.460
Kin-chan! It’s been a while.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:03.800
What have you been up to? We’ve been worried since we haven’t heard from you.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.580
Did you retake the exam?

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.910
Nope. I’m not going to college.

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:14.600
I’ll be a step ahead of you guys towards becoming an adult.

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.540
With this, I’ll be ready for you
anytime, Kotoko!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:19.160
Does that mean you’re going to get a job?

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:21.830
That’s right. And I’ve already found a place to work.

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.320
What kind of work?

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.860
That’s still a secret.

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:29.010
But I’ll invite you to my workplace soon, so look forward to it.

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:31.540
Kin-chan, sorry to rain on your parade...

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:34.750
...but Kotoko is going to college and will meet all sorts of guys.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.420
Plus, there’s no sign of her leaving the Irie residence anytime soon either.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.540
Right. So, why don’t you just
give up already?

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:41.890
How naive.

00:03:41.890 --> 00:03:45.160
I have the perfect “I love” plan!

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:48.720
“I love” plan? What kind of plan is that?

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.300
He seems rather persistent.

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:57.630
Class-A is doing last minute studying for the center exams?

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.280
So, will Irie be trying for Tokyo University?

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:02.380
Yeah, probably.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:06.250
Well, Irie should pass it easily.

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:12.300
I really wanted to go
to the same college as him.

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:13.480
But, I guess it can’t be helped.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:16.370
Good luck, Irie-kun.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:25.050
You didn’t forget anything?

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:26.040
Your exam slip?

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.440
I have it. Don’t worry.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.750
A cough?

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:33.000
Oh, no. You have a slight fever.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.260
That’s it! Wait a sec.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:39.960
This is really effective!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.720
You’ll be cured instantly! Here, take it.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.400
Hey, I hope it’s not what I think it is, but...

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:52.160
...this medicine doesn’t cause drowsiness, right?

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:58.760
Please avoid driving after taking...

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:01.200
What should we do? Throw it up!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.460
Forget it!

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.450
It should be fine.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.710
Onii-chan, you should hurry and go.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.650
Yeah. I’m going now then.

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:10.120
Good luck!

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:22.890
I’m really starting to feel drowsy.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.890
Damn it.

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:31.850
Gosh, what have I done?

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:37.900
Dear God, please let Irie-kun do well on his exams. Please!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:40.870
Irie-kun!

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:45.530
Welcome back! How did your exams go?

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.580
I was seeing double when looking at the exam paper.

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:50.810
And then?

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:54.020
My mind wasn’t really there either.
I might not make it.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:56.870
What should I do?!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:00.030
Because of me, Irie-kun’s future is...

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.500
Cheers!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.270
Congratulations on passing the center exam!

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:06.810
Congratulations, Irie-kun!

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:09.020
Geniuses really are different.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:12.910
Well, I always thought that Onii-chan would do fine.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:16.730
Of course, but this will have to do until we have the official exam results.

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:19.550
Whoa, this is something else.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:22.900
I knew that I’d pass after checking through the answers myself.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.920
Geez, you should have told me sooner then.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:29.240
I was worried because you said that you might not make it.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.390
But, I wasn’t joking about feeling drowsy.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:34.100
It’s because Kotoko is always doing unnecessary things.

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.750
Yeah, and also stuff like this.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:39.300
That’s so adorable!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:43.590
The examiner made fun of me and it was embarrassing.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:47.430
Honestly! Drugging me,
making me tutor you...

00:06:47.430 --> 00:06:49.810
...and causing rumors to spread at school.

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:51.140
I’m sorry.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.980
You sure don’t get it, Onii-chan.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:57.190
It’s more fun to have a life filled with suspense and drama.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.640
How is that fun?

00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:01.570
Kotoko is Onii-chan’s jinx!

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:04.560
Jinx?

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:07.320
Isn’t that right, Onii-chan?

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.570
Onii-chan?

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:12.080
Evening!

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:13.640
Kin-chan?

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:14.410
Kotoko!

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.960
What are you doing here?

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:20.600
I guess it can’t be helped, now that you’ve found out.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:23.300
Kotoko, I’m going to become a chef!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:27.240
I’m going to be working in this industry!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:30.420
I’ll marry you, and allow your dad to rest easy.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.620
A great idea to kill two birds with one stone.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:34.380
Hold it right there!

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:37.270
So, the “I love” plan you were talking about that day...

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:38.560
Yep. This is it.

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:42.250
Hey, I haven’t agreed to take you in
as an apprentice yet.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.320
There, there now, Dad. Don’t be like that.

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:48.030
I’ll come here everyday until you accept me.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.910
I’ll catch you later, Kotoko.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:55.710
I guess we have no choice but to get Onii-chan to become a chef.

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:58.780
Hey, Naoki is going to succeed my company.

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:01.450
To that end, firstly, he has to attend Tokyo University.

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.840
Please don’t decide my life for me.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:07.370
I’ve told you before. I still haven’t decided on whether I’ll go to Tokyo University or not.

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:09.720
What? Then where will you go?

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:12.050
Who knows. Maybe a place with good cafeteria food.

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:13.510
Quit joking around!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:14.870
Listen here, Naoki!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:18.260
If you keep on underestimating life, you’ll eventually run into big problems!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.650
Fine with me.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.960
You and your attitude!

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:24.990
Papa, it’s okay.

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:28.110
He took the center exam after all.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.510
That’s true, Iri-chan.

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:32.490
Come, Kotoko. Serve Iri-chan.

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.450
Here you go.

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:39.050
Oh, no! Look at the time!

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:40.990
Kotoko-chan, should we get going now?

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:41.660
Okay.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:47.320
We have something to do,
so we’ll be going first.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:48.580
Come on, Kotoko-chan.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:49.940
We’ll be going then.

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:03.310
It’s been a dream of mine.

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:06.110
To make valentine chocolates
together like this.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:10.110
Tomorrow will be the day which determines your future!

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:12.350
Be sure to succeed!

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:14.290
Yes, I’ll do my best!

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:20.330
I wonder if Irie-kun is really planning on not going to Tokyo University.

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:28.590
I think that Onii-chan should go to whatever college he wants.

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:34.850
But, he’s so lucky. He’ll be able to do anything he wants.

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:37.610
But, that’s the unfortunate part.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:43.620
Because there’s nothing he can’t do,
he lacks goals, or should I say dreams.

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:48.110
I feel like he wouldn’t be such a distant person if he could find that.

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:52.820
You really are amazing.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.370
I feel rather jealous.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:59.710
You and Onii-chan may have opposite personalities...

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:03.860
...but I think you make a good couple because you each make up for what the other lacks.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:04.770
Oba-sama...

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.850
So, let’s work hard for tomorrow.

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:08.580
Yes!

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.840
It’s done!

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.150
I have a good feeling about this!

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.010
Oh, no! It’s already this late?!

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:26.430
I’m off.

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:29.260
Shouldn’t you wait for Kotoko-chan?

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:30.430
Why should I?

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:32.690
He’s so cold.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.500
Where’s Irie-kun?

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.440
He just left the house. Hurry!

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.900
Kotoko-chan, are you all right?

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:45.480
I’m fine!

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.750
I’m going!

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.830
Good luck!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.590
There he is! Irie-kun!

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:59.710
Expired?!

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:02.700
Please be careful, the doors are closing.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.070
No way...

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:30.790
That’s right. Class-A definitely wouldn’t be in the Valentine’s Day mood now.

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:41.010
What? So, you still haven’t given it to him?

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:44.580
I don’t have the courage to step into Class-A during the exam period...

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:45.940
What is she doing?

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:48.110
But, I’m definitely going to give it to him during lunch break.

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:50.370
I pulled an all-nighter to make this after all.

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.310
What’s wrong?

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.610
My stomach really hurts.

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:56.870
Oh, no. Did you eat something weird?

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:00.130
No, I didn’t have time to eat breakfast this morning.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:03.490
Come to think of it,
I sampled the chocolates.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.810
Serious? Isn’t that really bad?

00:12:06.810 --> 00:12:10.610
I think you should reconsider giving those chocolates to Irie.

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:19.500
It really might be a bad idea.

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:22.450
You didn’t give it to him?

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.090
Yes. If I cause him an upset stomach with the chocolates,

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:27.450
then I’ll be repeating the same mistake, like with the medicine.

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:30.040
How’s your stomach by the way,
Kotoko-chan?

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:31.710
I’m fine now.

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.700
That’s good then.

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:38.350
But, it’s too bad that you have to give up on the chocolates.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.980
I wonder if there are any other methods.

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:43.050
Other methods?

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:49.740
All done!

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.090
What the heck is that?

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:53.240
A good luck charm.

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.910
I made it while praying that you’d pass.

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.670
Oh, my, Kotoko-chan!

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:03.030
Haven’t you learned from those chocolates that time?

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:04.020
Hey, Yuuki!

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:07.550
Didn’t Kotoko get an upset stomach after eating those chocolates?

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.900
It’ll be okay this time!

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.440
I’m sure it’s blessed by God.

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:12.150
Good luck, Irie-kun!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:14.140
Good for you, Onii-chan.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:16.450
Thank you so much, Kotoko-chan.

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:18.440
Come on, say something too.

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.830
Fine, fine. Thank you very much.

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:21.270
Hey!

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:23.630
I’m okay with it.

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:25.580
Are you okay on time?

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.200
You’ll be late if you waste time here.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.200
There’s still plenty of time.

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:30.910
Don’t run away.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.530
As if I’d do that now?!

00:13:33.210 --> 00:13:35.920
Should I come with you?

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:37.820
I’ve made up my mind!

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:41.800
I’ll make sure Irie-kun enters the Tokyo University exam hall with my own eyes!

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.190
That’s a good idea.

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:47.170
I’m counting on you, Kotoko-chan.

00:13:47.630 --> 00:13:49.930
Yes, just leave it to me!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.350
Next stop, Yotsuya.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:57.570
Hey, are you nervous?

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:58.730
I’m not.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:02.900
That’s amazing. I kept going to the toilet during the high school entrance exams.

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.590
I’m okay. It’s nothing.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:13.070
I wonder what’s wrong.
My stomach is hurting again.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:15.410
And I didn’t eat anything weird
today either.

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.920
There sure are a lot of people.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.220
Hey, we transfer at the next stop, don’t we?

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:26.920
Yeah.

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:30.870
What’s wrong?

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:32.900
My bag is stuck.

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:34.980
No way!

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.890
Hey, at the next stop, the door opens...

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.520
...on the other side!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.890
Wait, I’ll remove it right away.

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:42.210
We’ll be arriving at Ochanomizu momentarily.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:44.110
Oh, no! I can’t untie it.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.460
Please exit to your right.

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:50.860
Irie-kun, go on first.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.820
I can’t get off empty handed!

00:14:58.530 --> 00:14:59.030
It’s loose!

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:00.240
The doors are closing. Please be careful.

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:02.230
Wait! We’re getting off

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:02.750
The doors are closing. Please be careful.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:09.550
That was close!

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.860
It’s a good thing I came.

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:15.470
This wouldn’t have happened if you didn’t give me that charm!

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.730
Enough already, just go home.

00:15:25.590 --> 00:15:27.080
Do what you want.

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.860
My stomach is hurting again...

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:36.750
Until Irie-kun walks through the Tokyo University gate...

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:39.870
That’s right, I have to make sure.

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:46.750
Are you happy now? See you then.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:48.880
Good luck.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:56.370
Are you all right?

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.100
Hey!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:06.270
I’m fine. I’m totally fine.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.560
So, hurry to your exams.

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:12.900
Hey, Kotoko!

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:17.200
Where’s the hospital in this area?

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.530
The university hospital is down there.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:21.310
Irie-kun...

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:23.170
The exam...

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.880
It’s appendicitis.

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.010
She’s probably endured it for a while.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:36.540
I’m sure she’s been in pain until now.

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:39.180
Irie-kun, hurry...

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:40.600
Kotoko-chan.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:41.180
Kotoko.

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:45.120
Kotoko, are you all right?

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:47.560
How’s the pain? Is it gone?

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:50.500
Kotoko-chan, it was appendicitis.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:53.210
But it’s okay. They said that you can go home tonight.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.430
Appendicitis?

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.950
Sheesh, you really had me scared back there.

00:16:57.460 --> 00:17:01.410
I thought my heart was gonna fly out
when Naoki-kun called.

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:04.060
Irie-kun! Where’s Irie-kun?

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:07.220
It’s okay. I’m sure he’s in the middle of his exams now.

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:10.930
He’ll surely come back getting first again, so no need to worry.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:13.550
Irie-kun?!

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:14.920
Oh, you’re here.

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:18.110
Onii-chan, didn’t you go for your exams?

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:20.370
No. I was hungry, so I went to eat.

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:22.850
Then, what about the Tokyo University exam?

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:24.730
I didn’t take it.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:26.730
Didn’t take it...?

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:30.860
It’s my fault...

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:36.190
It really is my fault this time...

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:39.390
It’s my fault that Irie-kun’s future...

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.950
Iri-chan, I’m so sorry!

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:48.460
What are you doing, Ai-chan?

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:51.960
Because of my daughter,
Naoki-kun’s exam...

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:54.030
Please raise your head.

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:57.220
Naoki chose not to go to the exam himself.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:58.800
But...

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:04.430
That’s right. Now Onii-chan can attend the same university as Kotoko-chan.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:06.510
I’m really happy.

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:12.470
I really wanted to film Onii-chan carrying Kotoko-chan to the hospital!

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:16.180
Thank you, Oji-sama, Oba-sama.

00:18:17.980 --> 00:18:21.910
But, I can’t stay here any longer.

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:32.900
Goodbye, everyone in the Irie family.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:35.460
Thank you for everything you’ve done for me.

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:42.340
I’m going to quietly live someplace out of Irie-kun’s sight.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.680
That looks pretty heavy.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.850
Irie-kun?

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:50.060
You’re still supposed to be recovering.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.960
Don’t stop me! I can no longer...

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:55.320
I’m not trying to stop you though.

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:59.530
Are you leaving because I’m not going to Tokyo University?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:04.210
Because of the flu medicine that time, and what happened this time...

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:09.270
Just like Yuuki-kun said, I’m a jinx to you.

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:13.040
I’d probably bring you more misfortune if I stay.

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:17.270
I don’t want to cause any more trouble to the person I love!

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:21.290
Just to let you know, it wasn’t your fault that I didn’t take the exam.

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:25.390
I would have made it on time if I went after taking you to the hospital.

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:27.890
Irie-kun...

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:30.890
I’ve always wondered what I’d do after getting into Tokyo University.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:35.890
Even you’ve said it, that college is a place where you decide on what to do.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:41.440
But anyway, somehow recently, having you around
has made life more interesting and exciting.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:44.290
I was thinking that it may be a good idea to just go with the escalator system.

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:48.400
You want to go to the same college because I’ll be there?

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:52.060
You don’t have to stress that point.

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:55.320
Anyway, I’ve said what I wanted to, so go.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.980
It’s cold, so I’m going to close the window. See you.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.420
Wait!

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:06.250
I won’t cause you any more trouble, so can I stay a little longer?

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:09.280
I really don’t think it’s possible for you to not cause trouble.

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:10.680
You’re right...

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:13.800
I promise that life will be
filled with excitement.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:16.190
You sure are a smooth talker.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.900
That’s for certain.

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:21.440
Get back in the house before
my mother notices.

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.790
Hey.

00:20:23.790 --> 00:20:24.660
What is it?

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.660
Umm, Irie-kun.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:30.470
I love you.

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:32.160
I’ve heard that once too often.

00:20:39.420 --> 00:20:41.090
It’s done!

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:43.130
All right, this time for sure!

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:47.730
Umm, Irie-kun...

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:49.680
This is a small part of how I feel...

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:50.900
I don’t want it.

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.140
This situation feels <i>really</i> familiar.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:55.640
But, I took the trouble,
so at least have one bite...

00:20:55.640 --> 00:20:57.520
I don’t eat sweet stuff.

00:20:59.850 --> 00:21:02.120
When I become a college student,

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:05.860
I’ll become a great woman and make him think, “She sure is a great girl.”

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.200
We’ll be in the same college after all.

00:21:09.420 --> 00:21:10.780
By the way...

00:21:10.780 --> 00:21:12.790
What is it?

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:17.290
You spelled that wrong.

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:21.580
L-o-v-e spells “love” doesn’t it?

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:22.980
I’m talking about the “from”.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:30.750
This sucks...

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:12.320
I love Kotoko.

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:13.830
Kin-san is number one in Japan!

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:14.550
Yes.

00:23:14.550 --> 00:23:17.310
My speech practice is perfect!

00:23:17.310 --> 00:23:20.870
It’s almost time for graduation.
I’m gonna make it a great success!

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:23.720
Hey, Irie! What are you doing?!

00:23:23.720 --> 00:23:25.590
Kotoko!

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:28.420
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:29.780
Spiteful Kiss.

00:23:29.780 --> 00:23:32.130
I’m definitely gonna be happy!
